# A copy's delayed ability is the copied card's (CR 707.2, 603.7): Phantasmal Image entering as a copy of Bot2's Flickerwisp
# exiles Bot2's Mox Pearl, and the copied "return the exiled card at the beginning of the next end step" brings it back
# under its owner's control at Bot1's end step. (Before the fix the copy looked the delayed ability up on Phantasmal Image's
# own card, which has none, and the engine panicked.)

